ons_and_Potential_for_Prevention\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d47cbe716770da0e\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nWith respect to gender, most suicide by train attempts are by males, as is true for suicide overall (especially by violent methods) (Lukaschek et al., 2014;Wetzel, 2020). ... Behavioral and location‐related antecedents of train suicides ... Background: In the European Union, over 2000 suicides on railway premises were reported in 2020.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d47cbe716770da0e\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"October 16, 2025\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.researchgate.net\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2a597f8c7bea6884\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nBehavioral and location‐related antecedents of train suicides - Moritz - 2023 - Suicide and Life-Threatening Behavior - Wiley Online Library\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2a597f8c7bea6884\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1111/sltb.12941\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0705b2bb08fb5b4a\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAbstract Background In the European Union, <strong>over 2000 suicides on railway premises were reported in 2020.</strong> Identifying individuals&#x27; behavioral and location patterns just before they die or attempt to...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0705b2bb08fb5b4a\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"January 30, 2023\",\n      \"siteName\": \"onlinelibrary.wiley.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b73107161a241656\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nUQAM | CRISE | Railway suicides | Railway suicide in the world\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b73107161a241656\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://railwaysuicideprevention.com/railway-fatalities/railway-suicide-in-the-world.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONT